{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 3",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-622675779494412941 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/thephotostick/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=622675779393684109&sectionId=622675779494412941)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpah84uQ0b_text","label":"ggpah84uQ0b_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I'll admit it: technology and I have never been the best of friends.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Every time my phone flashed a message about running out of storage, or my computer asked me to update something, I felt a knot form in my stomach.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Not because I didn't care about technology.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Because I cared too much about what was on it.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">You see,&nbsp;<strong>my phone and computer hold nearly every precious memory</strong> from the last several decades of my life:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Photos of my children growing up.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Pictures from family vacations.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Videos of birthday parties.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">My grandchildren's first steps.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">School plays.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Graduations.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Holidays.</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Thousands upon thousands of moments that can never be replaced.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I constantly wondered what would happen if I lost them all, and these worries followed me every day, nagging at me whenever I picked up my phone or computer.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaLjpcMARz_text","label":"ggaLjpcMARz_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>\"Grandma, Just Click Here...\"</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEpH-rYk-J_text","label":"ggEpH-rYk-J_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Whenever I had a technology problem, I'd call my daughter or grandson.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">They were always kind, but I didn’t like having to rely on them.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I'd hand over my phone and watch them tap a few buttons as if it were the easiest thing in the world.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">\"Grandma, just click here.\"</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">\"Grandma, just upload it there.\"</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">\"Grandma, just back everything up.\"</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Just.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>If it were so simple, why did it always feel so complicated to me?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg13DkAKWzH_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg13DkAKWzH_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-06-10T095951.520.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCeGi_dxdJ_text","label":"ggCeGi_dxdJ_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">The truth is, <strong>most backup solutions seem like they’re designed by tech experts for other tech experts.</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Cloud accounts.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Passwords.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Subscriptions.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Storage plans.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I would start looking into it, get confused, and tell myself I'd deal with it later.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">But I kept putting it off… until something happened that changed everything.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8Pv9VtE3K_text","label":"gg8Pv9VtE3K_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>The Day My Friend Scared Me</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVPSVfIsqo_text","label":"ggVPSVfIsqo_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">One afternoon, a friend from church told me <strong>she had accidentally lost years of photos when her phone stopped working.</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Just like that.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Gone.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Photos of family gatherings.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Photos of her late husband.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Photos she thought would always be there.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">That conversation shook me.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>I realized I was taking a huge risk every single day.</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">If something happened to my phone or computer, <strong>I could lose memories from multiple generations of our family.</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I decided it was finally time to do something about it.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkBY88em1h_text","label":"ggkBY88em1h_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Then I Found </strong></span><a href=\"https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong><u>ThePhotoStick Omni X</u></strong></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggE1CRaGO1n_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggE1CRaGO1n_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-06-10T100916.484.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGTbMUEkXW_text","label":"ggGTbMUEkXW_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I came across ThePhotoStick Omni X while looking for an easier way to protect my photos.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">At first, I was skeptical.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Over the years, I’ve bought plenty of gadgets that promised to be \"easy.\"</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Usually, they weren't.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">But this one seemed different.</span></p><p><br><a href=\"https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong><u>ThePhotoStick Omni X</u></strong></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong> is a small device designed to help people back up photos and videos from their phones, tablets, and computers.</strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">It works with the most popular devices, including iPhone and Android phones, as well as Windows PCs and Mac computers.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg62-SJsX0F_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg62-SJsX0F_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_2.gif"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQ5Dp_czZe_text","label":"ggQ5Dp_czZe_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Knowing it was compatible with devices like mine made me feel much more confident about trying it.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">No complicated setup.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>No technical knowledge required.</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">No confusing menus.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Honestly, it sounded almost too good to be true.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggI_cvq8Qt2_text","label":"ggI_cvq8Qt2_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Could It Really Be This Easy?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAFvi7tmsK_text","label":"ggAFvi7tmsK_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">When my </span><a href=\"https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong><u>ThePhotoStick Omni X</u></strong></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"> arrived, I took a deep breath and decided to try it myself.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">No calling my grandson. No asking my daughter.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Just me.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I downloaded the free app, plugged in the device, and followed the simple instructions.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>To give you an idea of how easy it was, here's all I did:</strong></span></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I opened the app</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Plugged ThePhotoStick Omni X into my phone</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Tapped 'BACK UP FILES NOW,' and watched as it automatically found and saved all my photos and videos.</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">That's it!</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">The app <strong>automatically found my photos and videos for me.</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I didn't have to hunt through folders.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I didn't have to figure out where everything was stored.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>ThePhotoStick Omni X did the work.</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">For the first time, <strong>I backed up my photos completely on my own.</strong> And I have to admit, I felt pretty proud of myself.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpbrHxeQTQ_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggpbrHxeQTQ_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-06-08T113527.180.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwgCd77PY0_text","label":"ggwgCd77PY0_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Finally, Peace of Mind</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gggufm_0RG1_text","label":"gggufm_0RG1_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Today, I don't worry nearly as much about losing my family's memories.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I know my photos and videos are safely backed up.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong><u>ThePhotoStick Omni X</u></strong></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong> keeps everything private and secure</strong> because my files are stored on the device itself, not in the cloud. Only I have access to my memories, so I never have to worry about anyone else seeing them.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I know&nbsp;<strong>I don't have to rely on someone else every time I need help.</strong></span><br>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">And perhaps most importantly, I know that the moments I've spent a lifetime collecting are protected.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">As grandparents, we're often the keepers of family history.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">We hold photos and memories that span generations.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Those memories are simply too valuable to leave unprotected.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvUZgQuHYX_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggvUZgQuHYX_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-06-08T113514.855.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIZh9LPhEW_text","label":"ggIZh9LPhEW_text","default":"<p>I promise you'll love ThePhotoStick Omni X as much as I do. These are<strong> my favorite features</strong> that make this a must-have for anyone who isn't very tech-savvy:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gga464NAnKl_childItem_0","label":"gga464NAnKl_childItem_0","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#3D3D3D;\"><strong>Store Up to 102,000 Photos &amp; Videos</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#3D3D3D;\">With up to 256GB of storage available, there’s room for years of precious memories.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gga464NAnKl_childItem_1","label":"gga464NAnKl_childItem_1","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#3D3D3D;\"><strong>Automatically Finds &amp; Backs Up Photos and Videos</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#3D3D3D;\">No sorting or searching required. ThePhotoStick Omni X automatically locates your precious memories across your devices in minutes.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gga464NAnKl_childItem_2","label":"gga464NAnKl_childItem_2","default":"<p><strong>Works with ALL of Your Devices</strong></p><p>Easily back up photos and videos from iPhones, Android phones, tablets, PCs, and Macs all in one place.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gga464NAnKl_childItem_3","label":"gga464NAnKl_childItem_3","default":"<p><strong>No Wi-Fi Or Internet Required</strong></p><p>Back up your memories anytime, anywhere — whether you’re traveling, at the park, or capturing moments on the go.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gga464NAnKl_childItem_4","label":"gga464NAnKl_childItem_4","default":"<p><strong>Compact &amp; Travel-Friendly</strong></p><p>Small enough to keep in a diaper bag, purse, or pocket so your backups can go wherever you do.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2Y00t8OJh_text","label":"gg2Y00t8OJh_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>My Advice to Other Grandparents</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKo977aXx-_text","label":"ggKo977aXx-_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">If you've been putting off backing up your photos because technology feels overwhelming, I completely understand.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I was in the exact same position.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">But don't wait until something happens to your phone or computer.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>If I can use </strong></span><a href=\"https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong><u>ThePhotoStick Omni X</u></strong></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong> on my own, anyone can.&nbsp;</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggY21f1KquR_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggY21f1KquR_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-06-10T095843.554.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEPc9XMmCQ_text","label":"ggEPc9XMmCQ_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Plus, if you ever have a question or get stuck, there’s friendly customer support available to help you out, so you’ll never feel lost or alone.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">And believe me, there’s a wonderful&nbsp;<strong>sense of comfort that comes from knowing your family’s memories are safe</strong>, secure, and protected for future generations.</span><br>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">That's something every grandparent deserves.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggue_xvXn09_text","label":"ggue_xvXn09_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Where to Buy ThePhotoStick Omni X:</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg